notes.content:
Thank you for playing Craftopia.
We're aware of the bugs in the Winter Update 2021 released on Dec. 15th below:
• The bug that you can't equip weapon when other players equip two-handed swords in Multiplayer;
• The bug that the items displayed on an item stand aren't synced when other players join Multiplayer;
• The bug that you can equip equipment onto inappropriate equipment slots if you sort items in the inventory while performing the actions preventing you from changing equipment(such as fishing, drawing Katana).

Other small bugs and improvements:
• The bug that the sound effect of the skill "Iai Slash" isn't played;
• The bug that the wrong stats are applied to the enchantment "Burning";
• The bug that you can't rotate "Fishing Net" by pressing the R key and the T key when you deploy it;
• The bug that you can't rotate module furniture by pressing the R key and the T key when you deploy them;
• The bug that the skill "Freezing Ray" only hits enemies' bodies;
• The bug that the skill "Stealth" only partially camouflages you when you're equipped with the armor of the series "Beast Hunter", "Elemental Robe", or "Hakama";
• The issue that the blueprint display of floor building materials is covered by a player character when you try to deploy them with Snap Mode.

We're planning to release the hotfix patch to address these bugs and issues soon. Sorry for the inconveniences you've experienced, and thank you for your patience

Craftopia Development Team
